      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so ive been noticing something really weird with my smart bulbs and the thermostat lately. like the lights flicker in this specific rhythm, almost like they're pulsing, and it usually happens right after i have a private convo in the living room. i'm starting to get really paranoid that they aren't just \"glitching\" but are actually sending out some kind of signal or being used to listen in. have u heard of anything like this happening with these brands?",
