    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just random flickers... it feels way too deliberate. like, I'll be talking about something specific and pretty much immediately the lights do that weird dimming thing. and the thermostat screen has been acting up too, showing weird symbols when I'm not even near it. if it's just a \"malfunction,\" why does it always seem to sync up with what i'm saying? it's making me feel like I can't even breathe in my own house without being recorded.",
